<title>USA: Progress Financial sets 5 pct stock divt.</title>
<headline>Progress Financial sets 5 pct stock divt.</headline>
<dateline>BLUE BELL, Pa. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Progress Financial Corp said it has set a five percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>One additional new share of common stock is to be distributed for every 20 shares owned and a check will be issued for any fractional shares created by the dividend, the company said.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be distributed September 15 to shareholders of record on August 29.</p>
<p>Progress Financial is a unitary thrift holding company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
